        <mxCell id="notes_b" value="&#8226; 3NF - no transitive dependencies: employees stores DepartmentID but never DepartmentName.&#10;&#8226; Natural keys in OLTP (EMP-/DEPT-/PROJ-/ASG-/REV- CHAR(n)); surrogate keys are introduced only in the warehouse.&#10;&#8226; Self-referencing FK employees.ManagerEmployeeID &#8594; employees.EmployeeID.&#10;&#8226; CHECK constraints enforce AllocationPercentage 0-100, Rating 1-5, PerformanceScore 0-100 at the database, not only in Python.&#10;&#8226; CHECKs are also re-applied defensively by the ETL stored procedures (sp_load_assignments, sp_load_reviews)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="496" y="202" width="328" height="122" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

